   4. Payment Integration.

   The SDK is an API wrapper for the ONE store payment system. Actual
   payment processing is performed on ONE store servers. Developer must
   comply with the following:

   (a) Maintain and do not manipulate the integrity of the payment flow
       provided by the SDK;
   (b) The SDK does not expose credit card data; Developer shall not
       store, log, or process such data;
   (c) Display accurate product prices and payment terms to users;
   (d) Handle payment errors and failures appropriately and notify users;
   (e) Cooperate with ONE store's fraud prevention efforts and report
       suspicious transactions.

   PCI DSS Compliance: The SDK does not expose credit card data to
   Developer, therefore Developer is not required to obtain PCI DSS
   certification.

